1
00:00:00,415 --> 00:00:01,985
(Bernadette:)'cause I was always
the smallest kid in school,

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:03,990
(Bernadette:)so I thought if I
became a scientist,

3
00:00:04,152 --> 00:00:06,892
(Bernadette:)I could invent a formula
that made me taller.

4
00:00:07,055 --> 00:00:08,595
(Amy:)That's cute.

5
00:00:08,757 --> 00:00:10,927
(Bernadette:)Yeah, I thought it was working
for a while,

6
00:00:11,093 --> 00:00:12,233
(Bernadette:)but then I found out
my brother was just

7
00:00:12,394 --> 00:00:14,374
(Bernadette:)lowering the pencil marks
on the door frame.

8
00:00:16,098 --> 00:00:17,908
(Bernadette:)How about you?

9
00:00:18,066 --> 00:00:21,446
(Amy:)Oh, I guess it must have been
back when I was in the Girl Sprouts.

10
00:00:23,171 --> 00:00:24,551
(Bernadette:)Girl Sprouts?

11
00:00:24,706 --> 00:00:27,776
(Amy:)My mom made it up as an
alternative to the Girl Scouts.

12
00:00:27,943 --> 00:00:32,453
(Amy:)She didn't want me selling cookies
on some street corner "like a whore."

13
00:00:36,051 --> 00:00:38,221
(Bernadette:)How did that get
you into science?

14
00:00:38,387 --> 00:00:40,957
(Amy:)Oh, I went to the library
and took out a book on biology

15
00:00:41,123 --> 00:00:43,103
(Amy:)to see what whores did.

16
00:00:46,895 --> 00:00:49,935
(Leonard:)On the one hand,
if I say yes...

17
00:00:50,098 --> 00:00:51,938
(Penny:)This isn't funny anymore.

18
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,600
(Penny:)Just say no
so we're done with this.

19
00:00:53,769 --> 00:00:55,079
(Penny:)Will you marry me or not?

20
00:00:55,203 --> 00:00:59,153
(Leonard:)Ooh, interesting. Did you just
propose to me again?

